  "description": {
   "en": "Somewhere in the universe today, the music of a shopping channel can be heard. \"Earth Shopping Channel\" is broadcasting with a bold claim: \"We're selling the Earth!\"\nThe hosts are Natsumi, an Earthling, and Kamara, a Martian. The product they'll be auctioning tonight is... the \"East Tower\"!? What is the purpose of these two, who are selling the Earth without permission and making a profit!?\n\n(Source: Comic Zenon, translated)"
  },
